PCBoard 15.4 Revival (pcbirc) — License Information
====================================================

This repository contains code from multiple sources with different licenses:


Clark Development Company Source Code
-------------------------------------
Files in PCBSRC/ are proprietary source code from Clark Development
Company, Inc. Copyright (C) 1983-1997 Clark Development Company, Inc.

The source code was legally purchased under Clark's Personal Source
Code License program ($299-$499, see docs/saltair/BLT17).

Clark Development Company went bankrupt in July 1997. The source code
license terms permitted building PCBoard products. This project
continues that work.


pcbirc Crew Additions (GPLv3)
-----------------------------
New code written by the pcbirc crew is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0.

This includes:
  - PCBSRC/MAIN/SOURCE/UTIL/PCBISO/ (PCBISO utility)
  - tools/qfront/src/ (QFront FidoNet mailer suite)
  - pcbis/src/ (PCBoard Internet Services)
  - platform/fossil/ (FOSSIL drivers)
  - Compatibility shims (conio_compat.c, async_wrap.c, etc.)
  - All files in patches/
  - All .md documentation files

See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html


CodeBase Library
----------------
CodeBase dBASE I/O library. LGPL v3.0.
Used by PCBNLC for nodelist compilation.
See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html


QFront Original
---------------
Original QFront v1.20a by Robert Couture (Strstruc Computing),
1995-2000. Freeware/donationware. Original binaries preserved
at tools/qfront/original/ for reference.

Our clean-room rewrite (tools/qfront/src/) is GPLv3.


PPL Engine (PPL/pplengine/)
---------------------------
PPLEngine by Mike Krüger (mkrueger@posteo.de).
Apache License 2.0.
See PPL/pplengine/LICENSE


